website&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></li><li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-list:l1 =
level1 lfo1'>Fills out a form to redeem the offer (Converted =
Lead!)<o:p></o:p></li><li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-list:l1 level1 =
lfo1'>You contact them ASAP for next steps (or they use a promo code to =
purchase online, etc.)<o:p></o:p></li></ul><p =
class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal>If you =
decide to exclude the offer from your site, you are only using a =
<i>fraction </i>of your marketing campaign to convert leads. =
<br><br><br><o:p></o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal>Here&#8217;s what that =
would look like for the online campaign results:<o:p></o:p></p><ul =
style=3D'margin-top:0in' type=3Ddisc><li class=3DMsoNormal =
style=3D'mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2'>Prospect gets postcard in the =
mail<o:p></o:p></li><li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-list:l0 level1 =
lfo2'>If they&#8217;re interested, 95% of people will look you up online =
before picking up the phone. Browse and leave.<o:p></o:p></li><li =
class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2'>Prospect sees an ad =
from the same company they received a postcard from recently with the =
limited time special<o:p></o:p></li><li class=3DMsoNormal =
style=3D'mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2'>Clicks ad&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></li><li =
class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2'>Lands on your =
website again<o:p></o:p></li><li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-list:l0 =
level1 lfo2'>Prospect leaves the website (confused/frustrated) after a =
few seconds, because they don&#8217;t see the promo that brought them =
there.<o:p></o:p></li><li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-list:l0 level1 =
lfo2'>Sees ad again, might click ad/might not, because <b>they already =
know the call to action is missing.</b><o:p></o:p></li></ul><p =
class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal>If you need =
help, we sell <a =
href=3D"https://www.postcardmania.com/products-services/catch-that-lead-t=
ool/">standalone pop-up forms</a> and <a =
href=3D"https://www.postcardmania.com/products-services/catch-and-close/"=
>complete pop-up form &amp; email drip funnels.</a> These services are =
not included with Everywhere Small Business, please let me know if =
you&#8217;d like more info.<o:p></o:p></p><p =
class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal>I suggest =
you type out your number on the click-to-call buttons so people viewing =
the site on a device other than a cell phone (EX: computer) can still =
see your number and call you.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal><img =
border=3D0 width=3D238 height=3D89 =
style=3D'width:2.4791in;height:.927in' id=3D"Picture_x0020_1" =
src=3D"cid:image001.png@01DCC02C.D6704C10"><o:p></o:p></p><p =
class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal>Your =
homepage has a button that says, &#8220;Meet the Team,&#8221; but your =
team isn&#8217;t on the About page it leads to.<o:p></o:p></p><p =
class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal>Add staff =
photos and bios to your About page. This personal touch will help raise =
trust between the prospect and your company, making them more =
comfortable initiating a first contact.<o:p></o:p></p><p =
class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal>Questions to =
ask yourself when writing a personal bio &#8211;<o:p></o:p></p><p =
class=3DMsoNormal>Inspiration for starting the business. What problems =
were you looking to solve? How long have you lived in the area? Do you =
have a family? Hobbies? Charities you support? Organizations =
you&#8217;re involved with? Passions? Pets? Won any awards? Have any =
special certifications? The more personal the better. Including personal =
info makes it easier for people to connect with you and remember you. It =
also makes it easier for them to get comfortable with you. You want them =
to want to reach out to you so make yourself known!<o:p></o:p></p><p =
class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal>Please let =
me know if you have questions.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p =
class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal>If you do =
not know how to make the changes yourself or simply do not have the =
time, we can create a new website and/or a pop-up form for =
you!<o:p></o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal><b><i>*We&#8217;re not able to =
make changes to third-party websites that we did not create, however, =
you are qualified for our </i></b><a =
href=3D"https://www.postcardmania.com/products-services/catch-that-lead-t=
ool/"><b><i>pop-up forms!&nbsp;</i></b></a><o:p></o:p></p><p =
class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal>I&#8217;d =
like to see the site again once you&#8217;ve made the =
edits.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p =
class=3DMsoNormal>Thank you,<o:p></o:p></p><p =
